# Dynamic DNS edits — ignore substituted runtime zone files but keep the template
# deploy/coredns/zones/_acme-challenge.*
# !deploy/coredns/zones/_acme-challenge.{DOMAIN}
# Claude Code: per-checkout, per-person state. settings.json (no .local) is the
# shared, committable one — keep this rule narrow so a project-wide config can
# still be added later without fighting the ignore.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.playwright-mcp/
